    "detail": "The location is very good as just opposite of Odean Mall.. The room is clean but the washroom cleanliness need to improve as some other guest make it quite alot of hair on the floor but no one clean it.. The water pressure is SUPER LOW so only can have a quick bath and can't wash hair.. No provide hair dryer and towel and toothbrush set so you need to bring your own one.. But still a very good place to stay if you just staying for 1 night & if you wan to save more money on shopping, then this is the place as is really cheap and good location.. Suggest not to take tuk tuk from train station as is just within 10 minutes walking and tuk tuk charge for at least 20 baht per person..",
